Scope Settings file Commands directory project <code>.claude/settings.json</code> <code>.claude/commands/</code> global <code>~/.claude/settings.json</code> <code>~/.claude/commands/</code> <p>The MCP entry written into settings looks like:</p> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "jsat": {
      "command": "/path/to/jsat",
      "args": ["mcp-server", "--repo", "/absolute/path/to/project"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
